<!-- start booking terms -->
<section class="bbcc-section bbcc-section-alt">
    <div class="container-lg">
        <div class="row g-4 g-lg-5 align-items-start">
            <div class="col-12 col-lg-7">
                <h2 class="bbcc-section-title">Terms &amp; Conditions</h2>
                <p class="bbcc-lead">Bali Beach Country Club court booking — please read before completing your booking.</p>

                <div class="bbcc-terms">
                    <h3>Booking Confirmation</h3>
                    <p>
                        All bookings are subject to availability and will only be confirmed upon successful payment.
                        A booking confirmation email or WhatsApp will be sent upon completion.
                    </p>

                    <h3>Cancellation &amp; Refund Policy</h3>
                    <p>
                        Cancellations made more than 24 hours before the booking time are eligible for a full refund.
                        Cancellations made within 24 hours of the booking will not be refunded.
                        No-shows will be charged in full.
                    </p>

                    <h3>Rescheduling</h3>
                    <p>
                        You may request to reschedule your booking at least 12 hours prior to the original time, subject to availability.
                    </p>

                    <h3>Arrival &amp; Check-In</h3>
                    <p>
                        Please arrive 15 minutes before your booking time and check in at the front desk or via QR code.
                        Bookings will be held for 15 minutes past the scheduled start time; after that, the slot may be released.
                    </p>

                    <h3>Dress Code &amp; Conduct</h3>
                    <p>
                        Appropriate sports attire and non-marking court shoes are required.
                        Players must respect club staff, other guests, and facilities. Misconduct may result in being barred from future bookings.
                    </p>

                    <h3>Court Usage</h3>
                    <p>
                        Courts are available for use strictly during the allotted time only.
                        Additional usage will incur extra charges if available.
                        The club is not liable for any personal injury, loss, or damage to personal property during your visit.
                        Players assume full responsibility for their own safety and belongings.
                    </p>

                    <h3>Weather Policy (Outdoor Courts Only)</h3>
                    <p>
                        In the event of rain or unplayable conditions, bookings may be rescheduled or refunded at the discretion of the club.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-12 col-lg-5">
                <div class="bbcc-terms-image">
                    <%= image_tag("images/image-4.png", alt: "Bali Beach Country Club courts") %>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<!-- end booking terms -->
